[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 21490.39, "timestamp": "05:58:10", "text": "呃，你應該變成蜘蛛人的子版本。呃，我能飛，兄弟"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21492.788, "timestamp": "05:58:12", "text": "。真的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21496.19, "timestamp": "05:58:16", "text": "。是啊。真的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21502.948, "timestamp": "05:58:22", "text": "還有麥芽和絲綢，我的天。謝謝。 [音樂]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21512.07, "timestamp": "05:58:32", "text": "什麼笑話？呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21516.628, "timestamp": "05:58:36", "text": "，精準。精準。我的天。你需要精準幹什麼？但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21526.948, "timestamp": "05:58:46", "text": "你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21529.83, "timestamp": "05:58:49", "text": "沒有。等等。精準不是必需的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21535.11, "timestamp": "05:58:55", "text": "我的意思是，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21538.868, "timestamp": "05:58:58", "text": "如果你想用的話可以用。隨你便。還有，呃，我想問一下，這遊戲裡有表情動作嗎？等等，那是什麼？我"}]